# VoxelHTTP REST API Server

1. Grab CSNZ voxel metadata database [here](https://github.com/csoreserver/unified-csovoxel-backup/blob/csnz/voxelhttp_metadata_distilled.sqlite.db),

2. Modify file `voxelhttp.env`, change `db.sqlite3` to database file name (ie. `voxelhttp_metadata_distilled.sqlite.db`),

3. Run development web server by executing commands:
   ```bash
   poetry update
   poetry install
   poetry run fastapi dev
   ```

